{
  "_note": "AuthZEN 1.0 section 8 (Action Search API) with run limits (ADR-0010): a search charges nothing. The token may call pay once. Two searches both return pay; the evaluation after them is still allowed with calls_remaining 1, so neither search spent the call; once the evaluation spent it, the search no longer returns pay, because the evaluation would now be budget_exhausted. create_issue, delete_repo and read_file are outside the token's capabilities.",
